# The harness image COPYs SKILL.md, config.ini, specs/, src/, scripts/,
# fixtures/ and harness/. Everything listed here is upload cost on every
# rebuild -- outputs/ is the one that grows without bound as a corpus run
# proceeds. Keep this list conservative: excluding something the Dockerfile
# COPYs fails the build at that line, not here.
.git
.github
outputs
runs
**/__pycache__
